Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.93,0:00:05.26,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,These shocks are very useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:08.95,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,They draw someone's \Nfundamental nature to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.13,0:00:11.82,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:14.83,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Show me the brutality you've been hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:20.17,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the shock will prove too intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:22.29,main,Zodyl,0,0,0,,and he'll be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:27.44,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm not... finished yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:30.37,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Until I prove myself....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:31.72,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm not dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:42.51,main,Zanka's Father,0,0,0,,Steadfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:45.53,main,Zanka's Father,0,0,0,,Virtuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:52.80,main,Zanka's Father,0,0,0,,Generation to generation, the proud \Nbloodline of the Nijiku Clan has persevered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:59.25,main,Zanka's Father,0,0,0,,Indeed, your older brother and sister \Nfollowed in my footsteps to join the Hell Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:02.89,main,Zanka's Father,0,0,0,,and shoulder the burden \Nof rule over the Ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:06.48,main,Zanka's Father,0,0,0,,Do you understand what I'm telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.81,main,Zanka's Father,0,0,0,,Zanka?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:13.25,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:32.72,main,Teacher A,0,0,0,,Threats we face here on the Ground include
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:39.16,main,Teacher A,0,0,0,,trash beasts, garbage rain, and diseases \Nspread from hazardous material.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:43.67,main,Teacher A,0,0,0,,But there is something \Nyou must never forget—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:48.16,main,Teacher A,0,0,0,,The greatest threat of all is your fellow man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:52.42,main,Teacher A,0,0,0,,The Hell Guard is a crucial institution \Nfor keeping humanity in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:57.28,main,Teacher A,0,0,0,,What await you here at the \NCentral Hell Guard Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:02:00.13,main,Teacher A,0,0,0,,are rigorous trials and unsparing rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:05.89,main,Teacher A,0,0,0,,To achieve the strength the Hell Guards need, \Nyou must learn through competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.94,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,There he goes with the same ol' lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:12.07,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Can't believe it's new trainee time already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:16.58,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,Rumor says this batch's \Ngot someone real impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:18.16,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Male or female?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:19.33,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,Female.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:21.99,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Wow! Wonder what she's like!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:29.17,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Zanka really carries himself \Nlike he's a cut above, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:32.92,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,His dad's one of the town big-shots. \NWe can't compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:35.84,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Noble blood, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:39.31,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,The Nijiku Clan's a house of elites \Nwho all get into the Hell Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.64,0:02:45.40,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,But Zanka holds strong under the pressure. \NHe always gets the best marks in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:51.40,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Bet the chicks all love him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:55.57,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's graduatin' top of the class \Nto take the Golden Throne for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:58.62,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Yeah, figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:03.28,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,We're mediocrities. \NCan't beat a natural talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:10.51,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,You're damn right about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:14.84,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be caught dead bein' \Ncompared to the bozos around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:20.10,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,You know how hard I'm always \Nworkin' behind the scenes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.48,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Just you wait an' see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:31.90,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'll take top of the class \Nwithout breakin' a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:37.03,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,Rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:41.81,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:47.67,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,We've been seeing a rise \Nin Giver crimes these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:53.40,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,That means we need a strong Hell Guard \Nthat can stand up to Givers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:58.69,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,You've all undergone hard training \Nin your three years here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:02.31,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,We're eager for any new talent we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:03.64,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:09.51,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,As a special case, this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:13.44,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,we've decided to accept a particularly \Npromising student into this class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:18.15,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,She grew up in the slums, \Nbut her abilities are undeniable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.99,0:04:22.10,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,I couldn't stay in the dark forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:25.46,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,In the face of the "real deal"...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:28.73,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'd learn what my weakness \Nand real strength really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:09.49,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,The Academy's "most exalted seat" \Nwas a chair called the Golden Throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:14.08,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,The only person permitted to sit there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:18.45,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,was the best student of that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:24.86,sign_ArialBlack,title,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,135)\shad0\bord0\fs8\fad(351,1)}Episode 17
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:24.86,sign_ArialBlack,title,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(323,220)\fs35\shad0\bord0\fad(351,1)\fscx75}Memories of a Mediocrity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:32.83,main,Student,0,0,0,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:53.79,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:58.25,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to beat every student \Nin our class during your first sparring session.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:01.45,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,You really do have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:04.94,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,You could even take the Golden Throne, Hyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:18.88,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,What's her problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:22.75,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,She was raised in the slums, \Nbut she thinks she's better than us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:26.62,main,Trainee C,0,0,0,,I ain't heard the teacher \Npraise anyone that hard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:29.78,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,She thinks she's hot shit \N'cause she beat us {\i1}once{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:32.85,main,Trainee F,0,0,0,,She's sloppy as hell. No fundamentals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:35.14,main,Trainee F,0,0,0,,She won't get far in the Hell Guard like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:39.15,main,Trainee D,0,0,0,,The only reason she beat me is 'cause \Nher crappy style threw my rhythm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:44.18,main,Trainee E,0,0,0,,Once I get used to her style, \NI could beat that beanpole in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:48.84,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm off my game today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:52.70,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,But she also beat Zanka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:56.66,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,Zanka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:03.32,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Heck, she's a tough one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:05.13,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I just couldn't beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:09.02,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Nice to see a style \NI ain't never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:12.48,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Guess I got a long way to go. \NBack to trainin', huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.33,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:44.87,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I just ain't put in enough effort yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:47.17,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm number one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:49.54,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I ain't lost yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.49,main,Hyo,0,0,0,,Your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:54.45,main,Hyo,0,0,0,,It's bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:58.01,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,She heard that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:03.57,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Heck, didn't know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.57,0:10:06.06,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Thought you'd gone back to the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:09.52,main,Hyo,0,0,0,,No. I was looking for a place to get water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.46,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Gotta calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:19.18,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Gotta say, you're pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:22.05,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Just got here, and you're \Na Golden Throne candidate already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:28.15,main,Hyo,0,0,0,,What good does sitting \Non the Golden Throne do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:34.25,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Well... it's somethin' a bunch \Nof big names have earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:36.41,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Hell Guard legends, higher-ups at Central...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:40.00,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,all kinds of famous folks \Nhave sat in that seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:41.90,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,It's somethin' everyone wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.15,0:10:47.04,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Though I hear my big sister never got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:48.30,main,Hyo,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:52.96,main,Hyo,0,0,0,,What does {\i1}sitting in the seat{\i0} get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:56.44,main,Hyo,0,0,0,,Do you just want people \Nto find you impressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:58.92,main,Hyo,0,0,0,,What good does that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:25.54,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,When you've got the "real deal" around, \Nyou see the fakes start to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:29.04,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,In some damn transparent ways, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.26,main,Trainee F,0,0,0,,You cut your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:33.24,main,Trainee E,0,0,0,,No biggie. I wanted a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:35.63,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Some of the fakes try to imitate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:38.47,main,Trainee C,0,0,0,,Hey, how'd you do that move?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:41.97,main,Trainee C,0,0,0,,I won't tell nobody. You mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:41.97,overlap italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Some of the fakes try to steal from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:46.14,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,Must be nice to be a natural talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:46.14,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Some of the fakes just disparage them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.94,main,Trainee B,0,0,0,,Yeah, it'd be way easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.64,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,They're disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.90,main,Trainee A,0,0,0,,Wish I'd been born that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:51.24,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:55.05,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,We'll be having a special class today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:58.75,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,We've gathered together a number of weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:12:02.27,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,Follow your intuition and \Nchoose one that speaks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:06.68,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,A Hell Guard must be able to \Nuse a variety of weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:10.84,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,but picking out a weapon that's \Nhigh-quality and suits your strengths
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:12.65,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,is an indispensable skill as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:15.10,main,Teacher B,0,0,0,,Let's see how sharp your eyes are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.91,0:12:19.09,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,The most disgusting one of all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:24.84,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,was the one who thought \Nhe was any better than the fakes—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:26.55,italics,Zanka,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:41.59,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Wow, so that academy even has \Nclasses on weapons selection and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:46.76,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,And that's the weapon you chose?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:48.91,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:52.05,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,What are you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:12:59.85,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:03.79,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Didn't you say the class was three days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:05.11,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:08.89,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,You've been in that makeshift well \Nwithout food or water all that time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:12.84,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,You'd be dead right now if we hadn't passed by!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:18.24,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I saw a hole, so I felt \Nobliged to crawl into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:20.82,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I can't get out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.79,0:13:24.45,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:30.60,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Guess we'll just sit here and enjoy \Nsome of your local leaf-shaped manju.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:44.97,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,The others chose the weapons \Nthey thought looked strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:48.64,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I figured Hyo would do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:52.99,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd go against the grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:58.98,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I picked up a worn-out piece of crap \Nthat didn't even look like a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:01.12,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,You hear about it all the time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:04.08,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,"The most awesome weapon \Nis the one that looks like junk."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:09.41,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,So it wasn't an awesome weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:14.01,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,It wasn't even a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.73,0:14:17.82,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,The school screwed up settin' up the table,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:20.82,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,and some random stick got \Nmixed up with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.79,0:14:27.93,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd be the one \Npeople were lookin' at that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:31.83,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Then came the moment \Neveryone was waitin' for,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:33.60,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,when the "real deal" chose a weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:42.05,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,It was this ordinary, unremarkable sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.55,0:14:56.42,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Man, I'm shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:15:00.35,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm the shittiest piece of shit \Nin the shit heap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:03.43,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm pure shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:07.92,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I was the biggest scuzz ball all along, \Nwantin' people to think I was a natural...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:09.28,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Now I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:13.42,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,A mediocrity can never become a natural talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:16.49,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Drop dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:20.08,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I just wanna drop dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:23.90,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm as big a poser as this stupid stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:27.13,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Just lame as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:30.81,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:35.50,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Can't a mediocrity still get better \Nthan natural talents?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:45.29,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Not that I know what makes \Nsomeone a natural talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:49.76,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,but if that's not what you are, \Nwho says you need to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:55.77,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Besides, whatever you say, \Nyou want to keep at it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:16:00.00,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,You're still holding on to that \N"stupid stick," aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:04.28,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Most people would call it rubbish and toss it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:06.13,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,but you're still clinging on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:13.05,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Not that you should care what \Na simple passer-by has to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:19.03,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,But you can't become strong \Nuntil you know your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.72,0:16:22.58,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:26.72,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,We'll be back in this city \Nto eat more of that manju.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:29.51,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you prove one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:32.28,main,Enjin,0,0,0,,That the average can eclipse the gifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:20.98,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Lovely Assistaff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.78,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.59,0:17:35.62,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna die until I prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:38.54,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:41.12,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,what a mediocrity can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:47.97,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Hey Zanka, old buddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:56.79,main,Zanka,0,0,0,,What a... mediocrity... can...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:18:00.71,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're hallucinating real nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:14.57,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Gloopy-goo toxin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:17.10,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Neurotoxin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:27.23,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Then throw in the venomenal hallucinogen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:32.41,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Well? Well? Well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:34.61,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,That's what I stabbed you with!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:36.87,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Crazy intense, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:38.71,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,It's phenomenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:41.81,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,No... venomenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:46.89,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,I got that one from a guy \Nwho tried to kill me with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:50.57,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,It causes hallucinations so vivid \Nyou'll think they're real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:53.86,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Then afterward, it makes you \Nwanna puke your guts out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.80,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,You won't be able to get enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:58.56,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.76,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,My damn ribs hurt, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:08.29,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Hey, y'know? When you break a rib, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:11.84,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,It hurts even to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:13.96,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,You knew that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:16.09,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Yeah, figured. Most people do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.35,0:19:25.52,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,I thought you'd give me a crazier fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:28.86,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Guess it's over already...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:32.78,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Maybe another Cleaner \Nwould've been more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.88,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Look at you! You're having a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:53.69,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,C'mon, man! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:55.48,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Let me in on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:56.73,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.51,0:20:37.92,main,Guita,0,0,0,,I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.73,0:20:49.93,main,Guita,0,0,0,,Aw, nobody's here either?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:53.15,main,Guita,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.15,0:20:57.69,main,Guita,0,0,0,,I dunno how to get out, \Nand I've been here all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:02.15,main,Guita,0,0,0,,You're my only friend, Roachie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:06.27,main,Guita,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:12.17,main,Guita,0,0,0,,Hey, I said wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:14.77,main,Guita,0,0,0,,Roachie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:47.52,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,The party can't last forever, Zanka old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:55.66,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Guess I'd better offer you up \Nto the trash beast now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:22:02.48,main,Jabber,0,0,0,,Good ol' Jabber carried out \Nhis mission like a champ!

